{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -560,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "# One MoE layer (L3–60) — dataflow with shapes  \nGrey bars = tensors (length ∝ channels, 0.08 px/channel); boxes = operations with their weight count. T = sequence length. L0–2 are identical except the FFN (see bottom note)."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -560,
   "width": 1150,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "Attention = plain **GQA**: 48 query heads share 8 KV heads (6 queries per KV head), head_dim 128. **Partial RoPE**: the first 64 dims of each q/k head (interleaved layout) are rotated, the last 64 pass through unchanged. No QK-norm, no output gate, no sliding window (config)."
  },
  {
   "id": "xin1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -246,
   "y": -300,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 266,
   "y": -310,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 6144]  from previous layer`"
  },
  {
   "id": "n13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": -251,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**input_layernorm** (RMSNorm)  \n6144 weights",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "xn4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -246,
   "y": -155,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
